{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113359","id":3056383863,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc62LLd3","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113359","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113359.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113359.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113359","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113359/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113359/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113359/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/bf04188fb5ca276e95129e0398a3ad50a70f4736","number":113359,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Fix MJPEG camera decoding on Linux","user":{"login":"shiena","id":1295639,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyOTU2Mzk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1295639?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena","html_url":"https://github.com/shiena","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/shiena/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html\r\n-->\r\nfixed #113357 \r\nMJPEG streams from cameras have two issues:\r\n1. V4L2 buffer size is allocated for the maximum frame size, which is larger than the actual JPEG data size. Passing the entire buffer to the decoder causes it to fail due to invalid trailing data.\r\n2. Real-time streams may have partially corrupted frames. The standard JPEG decoder strictly rejects these as errors.\r\n\r\n→ **Solution**:\r\n- Use `v4l2_buffer.bytesused` to get the actual frame size.\r\n- Add an internal function that decodes using libjpeg-turbo's lenient mode (tolerates partial corruption).\r\n\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097326,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTczMjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:linuxbsd","name":"platform:linuxbsd","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos